WEBVTT

00:09.710 --> 00:10.740
Teoritta…

00:11.190 --> 00:12.240
We did it…

00:12.780 --> 00:13.700
Yes.

00:13.700 --> 00:15.190
It was bound to happen.

00:15.620 --> 00:19.350
I allow you to rub my head
and sing my praises.

00:20.730 --> 00:22.460
Tell me, "You are indeed a goddess."

00:22.920 --> 00:24.840
"You are amazing, Teoritta!"

00:27.340 --> 00:28.800
You're amazing, Teoritta.

00:29.840 --> 00:32.130
You're a great goddess.

00:33.430 --> 00:35.770
Perhaps that's what everyone wants.

00:36.600 --> 00:39.090
When a job is completed

00:39.560 --> 00:41.010
and you're praised for it,

00:42.940 --> 00:47.570
some people probably think
it's worth risking their lives for.

01:07.480 --> 01:08.050
Hm?

01:08.460 --> 01:09.610
Help…

01:11.130 --> 01:12.590
Please help us…

01:13.010 --> 01:14.250
My dad…

01:14.680 --> 01:15.890
A creature did this…

01:15.890 --> 01:18.140
Tch. I have more people to protect now.

01:18.680 --> 01:20.020
Teoritta, stay here…

01:20.020 --> 01:22.040
Little girl up ahead.

01:22.040 --> 01:23.160
Hey!

01:23.160 --> 01:24.730
Fear not.

01:24.730 --> 01:28.110
I, Goddess Teoritta,
and my knight, Xylo Forbartz,

01:28.110 --> 01:30.740
will guarantee your safety.

01:30.740 --> 01:33.780
We need to treat
that gentleman right away.

01:34.130 --> 01:35.530
What is your name?

01:35.960 --> 01:36.940
I…

01:36.940 --> 01:38.450
I'm…

01:39.120 --> 01:41.180
Ah! Are you all right?

01:45.630 --> 01:46.590
Teoritta!

01:50.260 --> 01:51.230
Die!

01:59.430 --> 02:00.520
Whoa, damn!

02:00.930 --> 02:02.350
Did I just hit a kid?

02:02.350 --> 02:03.560
Huh?

02:03.560 --> 02:05.900
That's weird.

02:06.210 --> 02:07.190
Tsav!

02:07.190 --> 02:09.030
Did you just shoot a civilian?

02:09.030 --> 02:12.280
No, I saw Teoritta being attacked…

02:12.280 --> 02:13.200
Huh?

02:13.200 --> 02:14.490
Don't "huh" me!

02:17.450 --> 02:19.930
How could… this happen?

02:26.080 --> 02:27.670
Tch. Did she get away?

02:28.170 --> 02:29.070
Teoritta!

02:29.920 --> 02:31.050
Are you hurt?

02:31.050 --> 02:33.130
I told you not to push yourself…

02:33.550 --> 02:34.530
Xylo…

02:34.530 --> 02:35.680
What?

02:36.180 --> 02:37.240
It looks like…

02:38.430 --> 02:41.440
I need to learn how to use this properly.

02:44.250 --> 02:45.990
You blocked it with this?

02:47.230 --> 02:49.440
We need to buy a better one.

02:50.230 --> 02:51.610
I'll train you properly.

02:52.780 --> 02:53.850
By the way,

02:54.320 --> 02:56.580
is that a faerie disguised as a human…?

02:58.990 --> 03:01.700
That might be Spriggan.

03:03.040 --> 03:05.280
It seems you truly are a threat

03:05.280 --> 03:07.160
to the Demon Blight.

03:07.160 --> 03:09.460
Hmph. Just as I like it.

03:15.880 --> 03:19.390
A goddess's standards
are always high.

03:20.470 --> 03:21.420
Let's go.

03:21.420 --> 03:24.310
Back to those lowlife bastards.

03:24.310 --> 03:25.230
Yes.

03:25.230 --> 03:27.810
After all, that's where we belong.

03:28.150 --> 03:29.650
But before that…

03:30.690 --> 03:32.240
You understand, right?

03:37.030 --> 03:39.820
You must give it your all

03:39.820 --> 03:42.200
and sing my praises

03:42.870 --> 03:44.410
with all your heart!

03:48.040 --> 03:51.720
Approximately 130 civilians
arrived at the refuge.

03:51.720 --> 03:53.310
There were no casualties.

03:53.310 --> 03:56.210
As expected of
our Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights.

03:56.210 --> 03:58.970
It's all thanks to Commander Kivia's
excellent leadership.

03:59.510 --> 04:02.930
But where did the Commander
and the Infantry Lieutenant go?

04:04.600 --> 04:07.270
I guess they wanted us
to take the credit this time.

04:07.770 --> 04:11.610
After all, the Commander and Rajit
always get the credit first.

04:14.400 --> 04:16.610
Thank you for your gallant efforts.

04:17.070 --> 04:20.450
I hope the military and the Temple
will continue to work together

04:20.450 --> 04:22.580
- and strive for the good of this town!
- Sorry to keep you waiting.

04:22.580 --> 04:23.410
- Yes, sir!
- How did it go?

04:23.870 --> 04:25.010
- Well then,
- Frenci.

04:25.010 --> 04:26.330
everyone, back to your posts.

04:26.330 --> 04:27.910
Provide aid to the evacuees.

04:27.910 --> 04:30.540
- It's just as you predicted.
- Yes, sir!

04:52.940 --> 04:54.010
First…

04:54.860 --> 04:57.170
I need to repair the damage…

04:59.030 --> 05:00.260
and find…

05:00.820 --> 05:04.030
a new host body…

05:06.810 --> 05:08.250
Ah…

05:08.250 --> 05:10.370
There you are.

05:14.460 --> 05:17.300
I wanted to see you, Spriggan.

05:19.510 --> 05:20.800
Huh?

05:20.800 --> 05:22.200
You didn't know?

05:23.010 --> 05:25.890
Actually, when the Demon Blight
corrupts the surroundings,

05:25.890 --> 05:26.930
it has a unique…

05:27.430 --> 05:28.600
how should I put it?

05:28.600 --> 05:30.150
A unique "wavelength."

05:30.150 --> 05:32.890
If you're of the same race,
you can pick up that wavelength.

05:32.890 --> 05:35.730
That's how I tracked you here.

05:35.730 --> 05:36.940
Who… are you…?

05:36.940 --> 05:39.610
By the way, do you know, Spriggan?

05:40.490 --> 05:43.610
I'm a penal hero,

05:43.610 --> 05:49.950
but among the Penal Hero Unit,
my crime seems to be the least serious

05:49.950 --> 05:52.710
and the most straightforward.

05:55.410 --> 05:57.300
What do you think it is?

06:02.430 --> 06:03.300
Eek…

06:06.760 --> 06:07.990
It is…

06:09.390 --> 06:11.430
killing my own kind.

06:12.060 --> 06:15.350
Because I feel pleasure in such acts.

06:17.150 --> 06:18.810
Humans are amazing.

06:18.810 --> 06:21.490
They say this kind of hobby
is quite common,

06:21.490 --> 06:24.490
and the motive behind it is very boring.

06:24.490 --> 06:25.410
Don't come near me!

06:25.410 --> 06:29.120
- Don't come near me…!
- Being called boring is truly something.

06:29.120 --> 06:31.540
So I simply surrendered.

06:31.540 --> 06:34.670
I did everything they told me to do.

06:35.000 --> 06:37.310
Now I'm also learning
about their ethics.

06:37.750 --> 06:41.550
And I've come to understand
that to you, Demon Blights,

06:41.550 --> 06:43.720
I'm merely a murderer.

06:44.340 --> 06:47.140
- No!
- Killing your own kind for pleasure.

06:47.140 --> 06:50.600
- Let go of me!
- Such a trite and boring act of murder…

06:50.600 --> 06:52.330
- Stop!
- But to humans,

06:52.330 --> 06:54.880
- Let go of me! Let go!
- this seems to make one a hero.

06:54.880 --> 06:56.050
Why is that?

06:56.730 --> 06:59.480
I still can't properly explain
the reasoning behind it.

06:59.480 --> 07:01.070
Let go!

07:01.070 --> 07:02.190
Yes, yes.

07:02.650 --> 07:04.780
The sounds you've been making…

07:04.780 --> 07:06.850
are music to my ears.

07:07.280 --> 07:09.330
It excites me greatly.

07:09.330 --> 07:11.930
It makes me want
to take my time killing you.

07:14.960 --> 07:17.830
Oh, right.
I forgot to introduce myself.

07:20.000 --> 07:23.460
I am the Demon Blight, Puck Puca.

07:23.460 --> 07:27.680
Before humans, I call myself
by the name of this body's original owner,

07:28.090 --> 07:30.100
"Rhyno."

07:32.310 --> 07:33.310
Well then…

07:33.310 --> 07:34.850
Sweet dreams,

07:34.850 --> 07:35.890
Spriggan.

07:46.570 --> 07:49.450
I'm unable to continue the mission…

07:49.990 --> 07:54.000
I'll disappoint my king again…

07:56.870 --> 07:57.750
Yes.

07:58.420 --> 08:01.290
I used a Blood Doll as a substitute.

08:02.670 --> 08:05.630
That Holy Sword is too dangerous…

08:06.300 --> 08:11.430
To kill them, I need more human blood…

08:16.640 --> 08:18.940
I've heard of your valiant efforts.

08:19.520 --> 08:20.480
Well done.

08:20.980 --> 08:21.970
Outstanding.

08:22.770 --> 08:24.180
Thank you.

08:25.320 --> 08:30.820
I've also heard that your deployment
and command were impeccable, Uncle.

08:31.210 --> 08:32.770
It was merely good fortune.

08:33.429 --> 08:36.159
It must've been a blessing
from the ancient saints.

08:37.330 --> 08:38.760
Your achievements this time

08:38.760 --> 08:42.330
should allow you to rise to the top
among the High Priests.

08:42.789 --> 08:45.690
If such an honor
is truly bestowed upon me,

08:45.690 --> 08:47.630
I'll begin with a personnel reshuffle.

08:48.130 --> 08:51.420
We need to be more united.

08:51.420 --> 08:53.140
When that happens, Patausche,

08:53.140 --> 08:56.990
we must improve your current situation.

09:03.440 --> 09:05.690
Personnel reshuffle, you say?

09:06.690 --> 09:07.460
Then,

09:08.350 --> 09:11.280
are you going to replace
the entire Temple leadership

09:11.280 --> 09:13.200
with members of the coexisters?

09:22.880 --> 09:25.560
Did you interrogate Lideo Sodrick?

09:27.030 --> 09:29.750
The envoy of coexisters he met…

09:30.260 --> 09:32.550
Mahaeyzel Zelkoff…

09:32.930 --> 09:36.180
When priests pray
for good fortune in battle,

09:36.180 --> 09:37.930
everyone uses this name.

09:37.930 --> 09:39.270
What's wrong?

09:39.850 --> 09:41.840
In the Central and other regions,

09:42.270 --> 09:44.190
it's pronounced "Zelkoof."

09:44.730 --> 09:48.690
Only people from the north
would pronounce it "Zelkoff."

09:51.290 --> 09:54.540
Considering the wealth required
to mobilize the Adventurers Guild

09:54.540 --> 09:57.620
and the clue that the person is
a Temple official from the North,

09:58.330 --> 10:00.730
we can narrow down the suspect.

10:01.870 --> 10:02.790
Uncle…

10:03.580 --> 10:06.630
Whenever you had the chance,
you took me outside to see the world,

10:07.170 --> 10:09.490
even though I was a child
who knew nothing about it.

10:11.840 --> 10:14.630
When I wanted to take
a different path from my parents…

10:14.630 --> 10:17.810
and forge my own path,

10:19.390 --> 10:21.770
you provided me with what I needed…

10:22.980 --> 10:24.440
This sword is one of them.

10:28.860 --> 10:31.010
When you took me out
into the streets,

10:31.820 --> 10:36.160
the alias you always used was Zelkoff.

10:37.530 --> 10:39.450
You remembered.

10:39.790 --> 10:41.490
How could I forget?

10:42.040 --> 10:45.610
Of course, I've also checked
your movement records.

10:46.070 --> 10:47.920
And in the previous battle,

10:48.460 --> 10:52.090
the unit that discovered the Demon Blight
invading the Inland District,

10:53.220 --> 10:54.970
according to you,

10:55.390 --> 10:58.010
was Unit 7110.

10:59.220 --> 11:02.000
However, no such unit exists.

11:05.230 --> 11:07.480
You've done your research.

11:12.440 --> 11:13.320
Uncle.

11:14.240 --> 11:16.410
Why are you siding with the coexisters?

11:18.620 --> 11:20.750
It's for the people I care about.

11:21.790 --> 11:24.040
Please don't move, Uncle!

11:25.790 --> 11:28.460
Me and my family.

11:28.460 --> 11:29.500
Uncle!

11:31.420 --> 11:35.110
And the faithful
who devote themselves to the Temple.

11:35.760 --> 11:38.180
I want to save them.

11:40.870 --> 11:41.850
Patausche.

11:44.430 --> 11:46.810
Humanity will fall.

11:47.810 --> 11:49.150
That's why I hope

11:49.570 --> 11:53.530
that at least those with righteous hearts
and my beloved family

11:54.040 --> 11:55.610
can remain safe.

11:57.610 --> 11:58.570
Then…

11:59.950 --> 12:01.740
What about everyone else?

12:01.740 --> 12:03.620
I don't care!

12:05.330 --> 12:06.830
Isn't that how everyone is?

12:07.370 --> 12:08.250
Patausche.

12:09.420 --> 12:12.730
Or would you rather be a hero
who saves strangers

12:13.340 --> 12:15.800
instead of your own family?

12:16.220 --> 12:17.760
Uncle, I just—

12:17.760 --> 12:23.030
You're still too naive.
You still have a lot of growing up to do.

12:24.600 --> 12:27.060
Hurry and grow up, Patausche.

12:27.770 --> 12:31.520
Learn to love your family
and those around you.

12:32.770 --> 12:36.400
If possible, I hope you'll take part
in the future workings of this world

12:36.860 --> 12:40.200
as a member of the coexisters.

12:40.780 --> 12:42.320
I…

12:42.320 --> 12:45.370
Humanity will be defeated
by the Demon Blight.

12:46.120 --> 12:48.540
Among the surviving humans,

12:48.960 --> 12:51.250
we must take our place as overseers

12:52.000 --> 12:55.460
and lead the rest of the people
to the right path—

12:55.460 --> 12:57.110
Please, just stop!

13:01.180 --> 13:02.290
It's such a shame…

13:03.180 --> 13:04.180
Uncle…

13:08.270 --> 13:09.310
I…

13:09.940 --> 13:10.770
I truly…

13:11.730 --> 13:12.900
truly…

13:14.110 --> 13:16.400
respected you very much…

13:19.570 --> 13:21.030
Are you crying?

13:22.990 --> 13:24.020
Even if…

13:24.870 --> 13:27.260
those people have nothing to do with me…

13:28.040 --> 13:30.830
even if they are strangers…

13:31.920 --> 13:33.210
to abandon them...

13:34.380 --> 13:35.670
would be a grave mistake.

13:36.060 --> 13:37.050
Patausche.

13:37.630 --> 13:41.550
That's a very self-righteous
and abnormal thought.

13:42.680 --> 13:46.390
You could also call it
the heroism of an inflated ego.

13:46.930 --> 13:50.100
Now that I think about it,
perhaps I raised you this way…

13:50.100 --> 13:50.890
Shut up!

13:50.890 --> 13:52.850
Rajit, arrest him!

13:52.850 --> 13:53.610
Yes!

13:55.980 --> 13:58.070
Please, atone for your sins…

14:06.450 --> 14:07.280
Commander!

14:32.600 --> 14:33.810
This is such a shame…

14:34.650 --> 14:35.480
Patausche.

14:36.520 --> 14:39.110
I truly thought of you…

14:39.690 --> 14:41.110
as my own daughter.

15:11.100 --> 15:11.970
Hurry!

15:11.970 --> 15:12.890
- What's going on?
- This way!

15:12.890 --> 15:13.770
High Priest Marlen!

15:38.790 --> 15:41.420
Has Rhyno not returned yet?

15:41.420 --> 15:43.460
It'll be trouble if Kivia finds out.

15:44.300 --> 15:45.420
Venetim.

15:45.420 --> 15:48.260
It's about time we put
a collar or chain on that guy.

15:48.720 --> 15:52.140
You're one to talk, Jayce.

15:52.140 --> 15:53.720
Oh, my.

15:53.720 --> 15:56.100
I think we can just leave Rhyno alone.

15:56.910 --> 15:59.100
He could be taking advantage
of the situation.

15:59.100 --> 16:01.700
Or maybe he's captured a faerie
and is torturing it.

16:01.700 --> 16:06.280
I once saw him bring back a living faerie.

16:06.620 --> 16:08.240
Isn't that right, Dotta?

16:08.240 --> 16:09.110
Yeah.

16:09.110 --> 16:11.490
He said he'd make it a specimen
or something like that.

16:11.490 --> 16:12.330
Heh.

16:12.910 --> 16:14.080
Ah!

16:14.080 --> 16:15.160
- Hey!
- Bro!

16:15.160 --> 16:17.500
Please save some for me!

16:17.500 --> 16:18.670
Fool!

16:18.670 --> 16:21.930
You're the one with the least work.
What nonsense are you talking about?

16:21.930 --> 16:22.500
Tsav!

16:22.500 --> 16:24.960
I order you and Rhyno
to reflect on your actions!

16:24.960 --> 16:26.300
No way!

16:26.300 --> 16:28.970
I saved Teoritta from a crisis!

16:28.970 --> 16:30.300
Whatever.

16:30.300 --> 16:32.430
Let's get this over with
and call it a day.

16:35.600 --> 16:36.560
Xylo.

16:36.560 --> 16:37.460
Huh?

16:39.100 --> 16:40.130
Frenci.

16:40.940 --> 16:42.730
You look like a mess.

16:42.730 --> 16:44.980
Why are you just sitting here?

16:45.400 --> 16:47.900
I'm sorry, but we're closed for the day.

16:47.900 --> 16:50.000
If you don't want it,
then give it to me!

16:51.200 --> 16:53.950
I don't want to be scolded by you anymore.

16:54.370 --> 16:55.790
How disgraceful.

16:55.790 --> 16:58.410
And you call yourself
a son-in-law of the Mastibolt family?

16:58.410 --> 17:01.300
You're worse than a hibernating lemur.

17:01.300 --> 17:03.340
All right, give me a break.

17:03.340 --> 17:04.880
We're done here.

17:05.300 --> 17:06.220
Yes.

17:06.220 --> 17:07.130
However,

17:07.670 --> 17:10.180
their attack on this town
was just a diversion.

17:11.030 --> 17:11.930
What?

17:13.210 --> 17:14.140
Huh?

17:14.140 --> 17:15.810
You mean…

17:16.270 --> 17:18.099
The Demon Blight, Abaddon.

17:18.099 --> 17:21.410
It's said to have breached the defenses
of the Ninth Order of Holy Knights

17:21.410 --> 17:24.020
and launched a surprise assault
on the Second Capital.

17:26.280 --> 17:27.859
You mean my capital…

17:28.329 --> 17:32.490
It was attacked by the faeries…?

17:33.450 --> 17:37.700
They knew our every move.
We've been completely outwitted.

17:38.450 --> 17:39.330
Don't tell me…

17:39.750 --> 17:40.450
Yes.

17:41.460 --> 17:42.620
The Second Capital...

17:43.250 --> 17:44.250
has fallen.

17:47.590 --> 17:52.300
The Second Capital, Zeyllent,
is the symbol of the Federated Kingdom.

17:52.300 --> 17:54.140
It's also a key defense point.

17:58.810 --> 17:59.850
Sigh…

18:01.810 --> 18:04.770
Now, Galtuile Fortress
and the First Capital

18:04.770 --> 18:08.400
are like having a blade at their throats.

18:12.850 --> 18:14.820
I heard he was killed
by a close acquaintance.

18:14.820 --> 18:16.280
Isn't he a big shot in the Temple?

18:16.280 --> 18:18.290
Excuse me, please let us through…

18:19.580 --> 18:21.710
Why did you kill High Priest Marlen?

18:21.710 --> 18:23.690
- You're the one who should die!
- Move aside!

18:23.690 --> 18:24.960
You heretic!

18:24.960 --> 18:26.630
Sentence her to death!

18:26.630 --> 18:28.170
Alright, move out of the way!

18:28.670 --> 18:29.670
Commander…

18:29.670 --> 18:31.090
No way…

18:41.600 --> 18:45.190
Patausche Kivia, Commander of
the Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights.

18:45.560 --> 18:50.570
Why did you kill High Priest Marlen Kivia
and Infantry Lieutenant Rajit Heathrow?

18:51.110 --> 18:53.730
How many times are you going
to ask me the same question?

18:53.730 --> 18:55.160
He was part of the coexisters—

18:55.160 --> 18:56.240
No.

18:57.280 --> 19:01.330
You were afraid of High Priest Marlen's
popularity and abilities.

19:01.870 --> 19:05.330
That's why you betrayed humanity
and killed your uncle.

19:06.440 --> 19:10.050
As long as you can
accurately present the facts,

19:10.050 --> 19:12.080
I'll let you go immediately.

19:12.880 --> 19:14.800
What happened to my subordinates?

19:18.290 --> 19:19.550
The hero unit.

19:20.060 --> 19:22.220
What's Xylo Forbartz's status?

19:24.560 --> 19:26.520
Why wasn't there a trial?

19:26.850 --> 19:28.980
Let me say it in court!

19:32.150 --> 19:34.320
Please reconsider.

19:34.950 --> 19:36.990
We have plenty of time.

19:59.550 --> 20:01.180
My apologies.

20:01.680 --> 20:04.430
It took some time to discuss.

20:06.310 --> 20:08.980
Because there's only room for one more.

20:08.980 --> 20:10.770
I hesitated for a while.

20:20.410 --> 20:21.450
Hmm…

20:21.990 --> 20:23.870
Patausche Kivia.

20:23.870 --> 20:27.330
Former Commander of the Thirteenth Order
of the Holy Knights.

20:27.790 --> 20:30.630
Setting aside your abilities as a soldier,

20:30.630 --> 20:33.700
your mental strength is truly amazing.

20:33.700 --> 20:37.140
You killed someone important who'd
shown you kindness with your own hands.

20:38.260 --> 20:40.640
For the sake of people you've never met,

20:40.640 --> 20:43.930
you even punished
your most revered benefactor

20:43.930 --> 20:45.000
without mercy.

20:45.560 --> 20:49.230
This is clearly an act beyond
the scope of personal interest.

20:50.020 --> 20:52.520
It could be called a hero's conviction.

20:52.940 --> 20:56.430
Or perhaps, a mere delusion.

20:58.320 --> 21:00.820
How… do you know…?

21:01.490 --> 21:04.330
My goddess can summon books.

21:04.830 --> 21:08.290
You could also say
she summons information.

21:09.000 --> 21:09.980
Hm?

21:10.920 --> 21:13.080
Ah, I know,

21:13.080 --> 21:14.250
Enfié.

21:15.420 --> 21:16.630
Thank you.

21:17.590 --> 21:18.760
Are you…

21:19.800 --> 21:21.760
a Holy Knight?

21:21.760 --> 21:22.680
Hm?

21:24.430 --> 21:25.600
That's right.

21:25.600 --> 21:27.390
The Twelfth Order of the Holy Knights.

21:28.020 --> 21:32.230
So, we used to be colleagues.

21:35.230 --> 21:38.110
I'm here to offer you a choice.

21:38.570 --> 21:40.030
You have two paths before you.

21:40.530 --> 21:41.530
The first path:

21:42.160 --> 21:45.580
accept the death penalty
as a member of the coexisters.

21:46.660 --> 21:47.620
The second path:

21:48.120 --> 21:50.040
become a penal hero

21:50.040 --> 21:52.790
and continue to fight the Demon Blight.

21:56.170 --> 21:58.840
A hero will be resurrected
even if they die.

21:58.840 --> 22:00.800
They have no freedom of action.

22:01.510 --> 22:02.760
Nor do they have honor.

22:03.260 --> 22:06.600
They will sacrifice everything
for people they've never met.

22:07.350 --> 22:09.810
If it were me, I'd probably refuse.

22:09.810 --> 22:13.270
And personally, I don't think
you're suited for this path.

22:13.940 --> 22:15.100
A hero…

22:16.440 --> 22:18.440
What exactly is a penal hero?

22:20.110 --> 22:21.110
Sigh…

22:22.320 --> 22:24.740
I'll answer as much as I can reveal.

22:25.370 --> 22:28.120
I'm sure you've heard some rumors.

22:28.640 --> 22:33.540
The first goddess
has the power to summon heroes.

22:34.620 --> 22:37.060
Long ago, at the start of the Great War,

22:37.060 --> 22:40.380
she summoned heroes from another world.

22:41.090 --> 22:44.760
But she couldn't communicate with them.

22:47.390 --> 22:50.970
So the people of the past
changed their approach.

22:51.770 --> 22:57.210
They summoned those who died
in this world as heroes.

22:59.900 --> 23:02.080
Summon the dead…

23:03.700 --> 23:05.210
Resurrection?

23:05.210 --> 23:06.820
That's right.

23:08.490 --> 23:12.290
They will stand on the front lines
of the battle against the Demon Blight.

23:12.750 --> 23:13.870
HERO IS THE ULTIMATE PUNISHMENT.
Even death

23:13.870 --> 23:15.080
HEROES STAND ON THE FRONT LINES
is not permitted.

23:15.080 --> 23:16.120
TO FIGHT THE DEMON BLIGHT.
They continue to fight on.

23:16.120 --> 23:17.040
DENIED EVEN DEATH, THEY FIGHT ON.
THIS PUNISHMENT HAS NO END.

23:18.420 --> 23:20.170
So that's a hero…

23:21.920 --> 23:23.090
A penal hero…

23:24.050 --> 23:25.430
Precisely.

23:25.930 --> 23:29.010
And the reason it's now
a form of punishment…

23:29.550 --> 23:32.850
Well, there are many reasons for that.

23:33.350 --> 23:34.470
And,

23:34.470 --> 23:38.030
the first goddess's power is not perfect.

23:38.480 --> 23:40.570
If she resurrects someone multiple times,

23:40.570 --> 23:43.990
you know what happens, right?

23:47.740 --> 23:49.990
You lose part of your memory,

23:50.880 --> 23:53.790
and your mind is worn away…

23:54.620 --> 23:59.540
Humans seem to have
something called "soul."

23:59.540 --> 24:03.760
The more accurately
she can "recall" the subject,

24:04.380 --> 24:09.260
the more precise the summoning,
or rather, the resurrection, will be.

24:10.010 --> 24:13.810
Although Enfié's records can also assist,

24:14.350 --> 24:18.480
the first goddess is doing her utmost,

24:18.480 --> 24:22.820
recalling the memories of the heroes
day and night.

24:23.320 --> 24:28.030
There's only enough unused space
for one person left, at most.

24:29.700 --> 24:31.370
To go that far…

24:33.330 --> 24:36.190
Can a hero truly be a trump card?

24:38.580 --> 24:40.040
I suppose so.

24:40.920 --> 24:45.260
That's what I personally hope.

24:46.050 --> 24:48.370
These are the only secrets I can reveal.

24:49.220 --> 24:53.010
We'll talk about the binding sacred seals
and "repair" another time.

24:55.180 --> 24:56.220
Now then,

24:56.850 --> 24:58.210
what is your choice,

24:58.770 --> 25:00.480
Patausche Kivia?

25:08.530 --> 25:10.570
If I say I'm willing to become a hero,

25:11.610 --> 25:14.410
will you release me from here?

25:15.330 --> 25:16.460
Yes.

25:16.460 --> 25:19.290
But you must die once.

25:19.790 --> 25:22.670
You will be dismembered
and removed from here.

25:23.250 --> 25:25.880
That is the only thing
I cannot compromise on.

25:25.880 --> 25:28.550
You can either die
believing in the goddess

25:28.550 --> 25:30.510
or die not believing.

25:31.090 --> 25:33.430
Those are the only two options.

25:37.850 --> 25:39.140
I…

25:40.060 --> 25:41.980
was born into a family of priests.

25:42.520 --> 25:44.150
I ended up abandoning my family…

25:45.480 --> 25:47.990
My uncle, who was one of the few
who understood me,

25:49.860 --> 25:51.630
was killed by my own hand.

25:53.910 --> 25:57.730
I've thought countless times
in this darkness…

25:58.620 --> 26:03.960
how my subordinates and the hero unit
would view my crime…

26:06.170 --> 26:09.330
If they think I've gone mad,
I can accept that.

26:09.960 --> 26:13.180
But... if they despise me…

26:14.720 --> 26:20.310
and think I'm one of the coexisters
who betrayed humanity…

26:24.520 --> 26:25.980
To be seen that way…

26:27.470 --> 26:30.210
by my subordinates and that man…

26:35.620 --> 26:36.820
I can't bear it…

26:44.170 --> 26:45.240
If…

26:47.090 --> 26:48.210
If I can…

26:48.800 --> 26:51.000
raise my sword and fight again,

26:52.340 --> 26:53.300
then…

26:54.260 --> 26:59.010
I vow here and now that I will fight
for those I have never met.

27:00.930 --> 27:02.310
I will become a hero.

27:13.580 --> 27:14.780
I understand…

27:15.740 --> 27:17.490
You cannot regret this.

27:18.160 --> 27:19.700
I don't recommend it either.

27:20.540 --> 27:23.120
I'll take measures to ensure your silence.

27:24.540 --> 27:26.000
Personally,

27:26.750 --> 27:29.840
I'm still against making you a hero.

27:31.880 --> 27:33.030
However,

27:34.220 --> 27:37.400
I respect your vow.

27:38.600 --> 27:41.010
Now, take it.

27:59.490 --> 28:01.780
For the sake of humanity,

28:02.200 --> 28:05.330
show me your resolve.

28:08.000 --> 28:09.670
Patausche Kivia.

28:10.250 --> 28:10.960
I am...

28:11.710 --> 28:13.420
sentencing you...

28:14.340 --> 28:15.770
to be a hero.

29:26.910 --> 29:29.960
SENTENCED TO BE A HERO
